#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_layout
#! frames  220
#! poster  110
# the form at 15 pixels; ctrl+up three times: 18, 21, 24, the form grows and keeps its shape, the buttons stay at the
# right edge; ctrl+down four times: 21, 18, 15, 12; ctrl+up once: back to 15
0   move 450 400
10  move 330 330 15
40  key ctrl down
41  key up
42  key ctrl up
60  key ctrl down
61  key up
62  key ctrl up
80  key ctrl down
81  key up
82  key ctrl up
125 key ctrl down
126 key down
127 key ctrl up
140 key ctrl down
141 key down
142 key ctrl up
155 key ctrl down
156 key down
157 key ctrl up
170 key ctrl down
171 key down
172 key ctrl up
200 key ctrl down
201 key up
202 key ctrl up
